		select PACKAGE_libopenssl
		select PACKAGE_zlib
		select PACKAGE_libpthread
		help
		 libssh is a mulitplatform C library implementing the SSHv2 and SSHv1 protocol
		  for client and server implementations.
		 https://www.libssh.org/files/0.10/
		 Mislav Novakovic <mislav.novakovic@sartura.hr>

